cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "The software can be cited with the paper below, which describes the approach. This repository holds a later version of the code, which reproduces the paper's results."
type: software
title: "Gama: Galician Metrical Analyzer"
abstract: "Metrical scansion of Galician poetry. For each line of a poem, Gama gives the number of metrical syllables, the stressed syllables and the line type."
